        "filing_date": "2026-04-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, we provide less-than-truckload (LTL) logistics services with a focus on heavy cargo and international express delivery services in Southeast Asia, Africa and other regions.",
        "start_character": 13636,
        "end_character": 13821
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-044613",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-044613-42cf62bd8e9bbb78",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-044613",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "From time to time, we also provide temporary warehousing services to certain key account customers to store their products close to their target demographics.",
        "start_character": 15429,
        "end_character": 15587
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-044613",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-044613-42cf62bd8e9bbb78",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-044613",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Furthermore, as we look to offer additional products and services and expand our customer base, we may face competition from established players in new sectors we may choose to enter.",
        "start_character": 40091,
        "end_character": 40274
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-044613",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-044613-42cf62bd8e9bbb78",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-044613",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Furthermore, we provide freight forwarding services through the acquired business of China Oriental Express Co., Ltd.",
