        "filing_date": "2026-04-17",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Pursuant to the PRC E-commerce Law, we are subject to certain requirements in e-commerce business, including but not limit to the following: while handing over commodities, express logistics service providers shall remind consignees to examine the commodities immediately on the spot;",
