        "filing_date": "2026-04-17",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Risk Factors—Risks Related to Doing Business in China—Uncertainties with respect to the legal system in the jurisdiction where we operate could adversely affect us.”",
