        "filing_date": "2026-04-17",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The network transit fees that we charge our network partners for the express delivery services we provide to them primarily consist of (i) a fixed amount for a waybill attached to each parcel and (ii) a variable amount per parcel for sorting and line-haul transportation based on parcel weight and route distance.",
